  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2567350,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Smurfs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2569860,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's Smurfs? Just Smurfs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2571460,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Smurfs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2572380,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just Smurfs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2573500,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, wouldn't there be a movie like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2576070,
    "dDurationMs": 570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Smurfs!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2576640,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it just Smurfs exactly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2578590,
    "dDurationMs": 550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2579140,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no 'The Movie' or anything, it's just Smurfs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2581550,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Smurf~!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2584060,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me check it out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2586930,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Smurfs exists! 2025"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2589120,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It came out just this month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2591390,
    "dDurationMs": 6090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2597480,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003cKing of Kings\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2600160,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's something like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2601210,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's also a recent movie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2603330,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2605380,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "5, 4."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2606550,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trolls!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2608290,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trolls? Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2609900,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's fun, it's an anime I like about trolls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2612600,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2613940,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "5, 4, 3, 2..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2617860,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wait! Wait!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2619910,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it too fast?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2622080,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2625250,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2629870,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My head turned completely white in an instant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2632520,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, once it stops, it doesn't move."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2637320,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today's winner is me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2643350,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Too bad, I should watch more of the anime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2647280,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there were a lot of really niche anime titles that came up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2651330,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2652830,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like \u003cNausicaä\u003e."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2655550,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we even played a mini-game like this today, and when you all are bored,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2658820,
    "dDurationMs": 6710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "try playing it with your friends sometime, it's surprisingly fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2665530,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now I'm thinking we should talk about the next topic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2669130,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What would be a good topic for next time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2671810,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next topic is something we did last time when we recorded offline,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2678250,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it seems the playlist received a lot of love,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2683110,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I'd like to do it again this time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2685370,
    "dDurationMs": 630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A playlist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2686000,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But last time it was about when it's good to come travel in Korea?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2689930,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was \"five songs that are good to listen to when you come travel in Korea,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2694580,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so what should we do this time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2696730,
    "dDurationMs": 5750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This time, while you all are studying Korean and taking a break,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2702480,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we'll make it a playlist of songs that are good to listen to while taking a walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2708420,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should we do it with both foreign songs and Korean songs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2711970,
    "dDurationMs": 650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes, that sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2712620,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With songs that come to mind,"
